WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Lie on your back with your exercise leg straight.

2
00:07.000 --> 00:13.000
Rest your head and shoulders. Keep the other leg relaxed on the bed.

3
00:13.000 --> 00:19.000
Slide your heel towards your bottom, bending your knee.

4
00:19.000 --> 00:25.000
Keep your heel on the bed. Move within your comfortable range.

5
00:25.000 --> 00:31.000
Slowly slide your heel away until your leg is straight again.

6
00:31.000 --> 00:37.000
Keep your hips still. Do not force the bend or push through sharp pain.

7
00:37.000 --> 00:43.000
The heel stays in contact as the knee bends, then slides back out.

8
00:43.000 --> 00:49.000
Slowly slide your heel away until your leg is straight again.

9
00:49.000 --> 00:57.000
Use the range and repetitions your physiotherapist has prescribed.
